# Direct dependencies of the backend/worker image (see Dockerfile) and of the
# local development environment. Hash-Lock folgt spaeter -- requirements.txt
# is currently a plain `pip freeze` of the resolved tree, not a
# `pip-compile --generate-hashes` lock (see requirements.txt's own header).
#
# Version pins for packages shared with Weave-Ingest are kept identical to
# backend/requirements.in there, so the two services stay on the same
# fastapi/sqlalchemy/celery/etc. major.minor across the Weave system.
